Name:Rules pilot NNN - A stun counter eats an untap
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control a tapped Hill Giant with a stun counter on it, and have two Bursts of Energy (untap target permanent) in hand with two white mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-stun-counter-untap | If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, a stun counter is removed instead (CR 122.1d): the first Burst of Energy only removes the counter, the second untaps the Giant so it can attack for 3
